      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Management Inc. has issued shares of its common stock to each of its owners or their affiliates, who are also members of ATC LLC, in proportion to their ownership interests in ATC LLC.  The holders of common stock have the rights of shareholders under Wisconsin law, including the right to elect directors of Management Inc. in accordance with the Bylaws and Articles of Incorporation of ATC Management Inc.</div>
